<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  
  <title>Using console.log</title>

</head>
<body>
  <h2>Activate Debugging</h2>

  <p>F12 on your keyboard will active debugging.</p>
  <p>Then select "console" in the debugger menu.</p>
  <p>Then click Run again.</p>

  <script>
    console.log(5 + 6);
  </script>
  
</body>
</html>
